\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Illustrative data inspection, requirement inspection and external acceptance judging. Tables, formulations, evaluation values and check marks are schematic examples, not experimental results. Agents receive bounded raw-table profiles and write code that operates on full tables; the Requirement Checker does not see the formulation. Helper optimization is used where supported. Checker agreement is evidence rather than a correctness guarantee; held-out judge truth is not supplied to runtime agents.}}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:verificationlayers}{{2}{4}{Illustrative data inspection, requirement inspection and external acceptance judging. Tables, formulations, evaluation values and check marks are schematic examples, not experimental results. Agents receive bounded raw-table profiles and write code that operates on full tables; the Requirement Checker does not see the formulation. Helper optimization is used where supported. Checker agreement is evidence rather than a correctness guarantee; held-out judge truth is not supplied to runtime agents}{figure.2}{}}
