\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Recorded evaluation outcomes. Left: successes and unverifiable cases across three runs on the same 100 benchmarks; the remaining cases failed verification. Right: mean original-objective gaps on four selected frozen-model/backend combinations, three repetitions per policy. Hollow markers show all three observed repetitions per condition; short vertical marks show their means. No confidence intervals are inferred. CGA and Hybrid have different per-call limits; the plot does not establish a hardware advantage.}}{6}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
